#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:4
msgid "Display"
msgstr "显示屏"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:8
msgid "A lcd display library"
msgstr "LCD 屏幕显示库"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:15
msgid "M5 Series Display Libraries"
msgstr "M5 系列显示库说明"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:18
msgid "1. Display (M5.Lcd)"
msgstr "1. Display 底层绘图库（M5.Lcd）"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:19
msgid ""
"A low-level graphics library providing basic screen drawing, text, lines,"
" and color management."
msgstr "底层图形库，提供屏幕绘制、文字、线条、颜色管理等基础功能。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:20
msgid ""
"Can be used independently, suitable for scenarios that only require "
"drawing graphics or text."
msgstr "可独立使用，适合只需要绘制图形或文字的场景。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Access via**: ``M5.Lcd.fillRect()``, ``M5.Lcd.drawRect()``, "
"``M5.Lcd.drawString()``, etc."
msgstr ""
"**调用方式**：``M5.Lcd.fillRect()``、``M5.Lcd.drawRect()``、``M5.Lcd.drawString()``"
" 等。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:24
msgid "2. M5Widgets"
msgstr "2. M5Widgets"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:25
msgid ""
"A basic UI widget library providing labels, image displays, and other UI "
"controls."
msgstr "基础控件库，提供标签、图片显示等 UI 控件。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:26
msgid "Built on top of M5GFX."
msgstr "底层依赖 M5GFX。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:27
msgid "Suitable for simple interactive UI elements."
msgstr "适合需要简单交互控件的界面。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Access via**: ``M5.Widgets.Label()``, ``M5.Widgets.Image()``, "
"``M5.Widgets.Rectangle()``, etc."
msgstr ""
"**调用方式**：``M5.Widgets.Label()``、``M5.Widgets.Image()``、``M5.Widgets.Rectangle()``"
" 等。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Important**: ``M5.Widgets`` provides UI component **classes**, not "
"drawing methods."
msgstr "**注意**：``M5.Widgets`` 提供 UI 组件 **类**，不提供绘图方法。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Recommendation**: For new interactive UI projects, prefer M5UI/LVGL. "
"Use M5.Widgets for simple or legacy UI components."
msgstr "**建议**：新的交互界面项目优先使用 M5UI/LVGL；简单界面或现有项目中的组件可使用 M5.Widgets。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:33
msgid "3. M5UI"
msgstr "3. M5UI"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:34
msgid "A high-level UI framework based on LVGL."
msgstr "高层 UI 框架，基于 LVGL 封装。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:35
msgid ""
"Provides page management, multi-widget layouts, and unified event "
"handling."
msgstr "提供页面管理、多控件布局和统一事件处理。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:36
msgid "**Recommendation**: Prefer M5UI/LVGL for new interactive UI projects."
msgstr "**建议**：新的交互界面项目优先使用 M5UI/LVGL。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:39
msgid "Usage Tips"
msgstr "使用提示"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:40
msgid ""
"⚠️ Do not mix M5GFX, M5Widgets, and M5UI simultaneously, as it may cause "
"rendering issues or event conflicts."
msgstr "⚠️ 不建议同时混用 M5GFX、M5Widgets、M5UI，可能导致渲染异常或事件冲突。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:41
msgid "For graphics-only drawing → use M5GFX."
msgstr "单独绘图 → 使用 M5GFX。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:42
msgid "For simple interactive widgets → use M5Widgets."
msgstr "简单控件交互 → 使用 M5Widgets。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:43
msgid "For multi-page UI → use M5UI/LVGL (recommended for new projects)."
msgstr "多页面界面 → 使用 M5UI/LVGL（新项目推荐）。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:46
msgid "Common Mistakes to Avoid"
msgstr "常见错误及正确用法"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:47
msgid ""
"❌ **WRONG**: ``Widgets.fillRect()`` or ``Widgets.drawRect()`` - These "
"methods do not exist in Widgets module"
msgstr ""
"❌ **错误**：``Widgets.fillRect()`` 或 ``Widgets.drawRect()``——Widgets "
"模块中没有这些方法。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:48
msgid ""
"✅ **CORRECT**: ``M5.Lcd.fillRect()`` or ``M5.Lcd.drawRect()`` - Use "
"M5.Lcd for drawing methods"
msgstr "✅ **正确**：``M5.Lcd.fillRect()`` 或 ``M5.Lcd.drawRect()``——通过 M5.Lcd 调用绘图方法。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:49
msgid ""
"❌ **WRONG**: ``from M5 import Widgets; Widgets.fillRect(...)`` - Widgets "
"is for UI components, not drawing"
msgstr ""
"❌ **错误**：``from M5 import Widgets; Widgets.fillRect(...)``——Widgets 用于创建 "
"UI 组件，不提供此绘图方法。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:50
msgid ""
"✅ **CORRECT**: ``from M5 import *; M5.Lcd.fillRect(...)`` - M5.Lcd "
"provides all drawing methods"
msgstr "✅ **正确**：``from M5 import *; M5.Lcd.fillRect(...)``——通过 M5.Lcd 调用绘图方法。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Key Distinction**: - ``M5.Lcd`` = Drawing methods (fillRect, drawRect, "
"drawCircle, drawString, etc.) - ``M5.Widgets`` = UI component classes "
"(Label, Image, Rectangle, Circle, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"**主要区别**：- ``M5.Lcd`` 提供绘图方法（fillRect、drawRect、drawCircle、drawString 等）；-"
" ``M5.Widgets`` 提供 UI 组件类（Label、Image、Rectangle、Circle 等）。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:60
msgid "Screen Rotation"
msgstr "屏幕旋转方向"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:62
msgid ""
"The rotation value is relative to the board's normal viewing direction. "
"The values ``0``, ``1``, ``2`` and ``3`` select 0°, 90°, 180° and 270°, "
"respectively. A value does not universally mean portrait or landscape; "
"the physical direction depends on the board and the M5GFX version."
msgstr ""
"旋转值以主机的正常观看方向为基准。``0``、``1``、``2``、``3`` 分别表示旋转 "
"0°、90°、180°、270°，不能统一理解为竖屏或横屏；实际方向取决于主机型号和 M5GFX 版本。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:68
msgid "Normal Orientation"
msgstr "正常显示方向"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:70
msgid ""
"Core/Basic/Fire, Core2, CoreS3, StackChan: rotation ``0``, logical size "
"``320 × 240``."
msgstr "Core/Basic/Fire、Core2、CoreS3、StackChan：旋转值 ``0``，逻辑尺寸 ``320 × 240``。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:71
msgid ""
"Cardputer, Cardputer Adv, DinMeter, Station: rotation ``0``, logical size"
" ``240 × 135``."
msgstr "Cardputer、Cardputer Adv、DinMeter、Station：旋转值 ``0``，逻辑尺寸 ``240 × 135``。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:72
msgid "CoreP4X: rotation ``0``, logical size ``480 × 480``."
msgstr "CoreP4X：旋转值 ``0``，逻辑尺寸 ``480 × 480``。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:74
msgid ""
"These values apply to the firmware documented on this site. Older "
"firmware may use a different rotation mapping. For the 320 × 240 "
"controllers listed above, rotations ``1`` and ``3`` use a logical size of"
" 240 × 320, while ``0`` and ``2`` use 320 × 240."
msgstr ""
"以上取值对应本文档配套的固件，旧固件的方向映射可能不同。对于上述 320 × 240 主机，旋转值为 ``1`` 或 ``3`` 时，逻辑尺寸为 "
"240 × 320；为 ``0`` 或 ``2`` 时，逻辑尺寸为 320 × 240。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:79
msgid ""
"On a square display such as CoreP4X, all four rotations have the same "
"dimensions. Use readable text or corner markers to identify the "
"direction."
msgstr "对于 CoreP4X 这样的方形屏幕，四个旋转方向的宽高相同，需要通过文字朝向或四角标记确认显示方向。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:83
msgid "Migrating Existing Examples"
msgstr "旧示例迁移"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:85
msgid ""
"For Core/Basic/Fire, Core2, CoreS3 and StackChan, older examples that "
"used ``Widgets.setRotation(1)`` for normal landscape should now use "
"``Widgets.setRotation(0)``. The same applies to ``M5.Lcd.setRotation()``."
msgstr ""
"Core/Basic/Fire、Core2、CoreS3 和 StackChan 的旧示例中，用于正常横屏的 "
"``Widgets.setRotation(1)`` 现在应改为 "
"``Widgets.setRotation(0)``；``M5.Lcd.setRotation()`` 同理。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:89
msgid ""
"For graphical projects, update both the ``.m5f2`` screen rotation setting"
" and any rotation block. Check the generated Python, then save and reopen"
" the project to confirm the setting is preserved."
msgstr "图形化工程需要同时更新 ``.m5f2`` 的屏幕旋转设置和工程内的旋转积木，并检查生成的 Python；保存后重新打开工程，确认设置仍然正确。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:91
msgid ""
"For M5UI/LVGL, set the desired rotation before calling ``m5ui.init()`` so"
" the UI is initialized with the intended screen dimensions."
msgstr "使用 M5UI/LVGL 时，应在调用 ``m5ui.init()`` 前设置旋转方向，使界面按预期的屏幕尺寸初始化。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:94
msgid ""
"For other controllers or deliberately rotated layouts, select the "
"rotation that matches the intended result rather than replacing every "
"``1`` with ``0``."
msgstr "其他主机以及有意旋转显示的布局，应按预期效果选择旋转值，不要将所有 ``1`` 一律替换为 ``0``。"

#: ../../source/hardware/display.rst:98
msgid ""
"After changing rotation, read ``M5.Lcd.width()`` and ``M5.Lcd.height()`` "
"to check the logical dimensions. The origin is the top-left corner; X "
"increases to the right and Y increases downward. On touch devices, also "
"check that touches at all four corners match the displayed positions."
msgstr ""
"修改方向后，通过 ``M5.Lcd.width()`` 和 ``M5.Lcd.height()`` 检查逻辑宽高。坐标原点位于左上角，X "
"向右增大，Y 向下增大。带触摸屏的主机还应检查四角触点与显示位置是否一致。"

